sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Admin/HR/Manager
    participant View as "Web View (admin.attendance.check-in)"
    participant C as AttendanceController
    participant W as "Worker Model"
    participant A as "Attendance Model"
    participant S as "Shift Model"
    participant LR as "LeaveRequest Model"
    participant H as "Holiday Model"
    participant BT as "BusinessTrip Model"
    participant AP as "AttendancePhoto Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Admin->>View: Isi form check-in admin untuk pegawai
    View->>C: POST /admin/attendance/{worker}/check-in

    C->>C: Validasi request (worker_id, note, photo)
    C->>W: Validasi worker + cek off-day + cek shift efektif
    W->>DB: SELECT worker + shift/override
    DB-->>W: Data worker/shift

    C->>A: Cek attendance existing di tanggal bisnis
    A->>DB: SELECT attendance worker pada tanggal terkait
    DB-->>A: Attendance existing / null

    C->>LR: Cek leave approved
    LR->>DB: SELECT leave_requests approved
    DB-->>LR: Data leave

    C->>H: Cek hari libur nasional
    H->>DB: SELECT holidays nasional pada hari ini
    DB-->>H: Data holiday

    C->>BT: Cek business trip approved
    BT->>DB: SELECT business_trips approved
    DB-->>BT: Data perjalanan dinas

    alt Data valid
        C->>A: Simpan check-in attendance (by_admin=true, admin_id)
        A->>DB: INSERT INTO attendances (...)
        C->>AP: Simpan foto check-in (jika ada)
        AP->>DB: INSERT INTO attendance_photos (...)
        C-->>View: Redirect ke detail absensi + success
        View-->>Admin: Tampilkan check-in berhasil
    else Data tidak valid
        C-->>View: Redirect back + pesan gagal check-in
        View-->>Admin: Tampilkan error
    end
